{"id":8332032,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/1769","number":1769,"state":"merged","title":"【bugfix】FusedFloydAttention算子workspace大小修正","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/1769","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/1769/issues","body":"## 描述\n<!--在这里详细描述你的改动，包括改动的原因和所采取的方法。-->\n\n优化FusedFloydAttention算子的workspace内存占用计算逻辑。原计算逻辑在估算stage2所需工作空间大小时，未考虑n2维度的分块大小，导致在NZND格式、FP32数据类型等场景下，workspace大小估算不准确，可能引发内存分配与实际需求不匹配的问题。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n修改了FusedFloydAttentionTilingS1s2Bn2gs1类的GetWorkspaceSize函数。核心修正在于，将stage2工作空间计算中原本使用的coreParams.get_s1BaseSize() * alignedD因子，统一替换为coreParams.get_n2BaseSize() * coreParams.get_s1BaseSize() * alignedD，从而将n2维度的分块大小纳入计算。此修改覆盖了无需切D（dSize <= 64）和需要切D（dSize > 64）两种场景，确保了工作空间估算的准确性。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。例如：关联Issue #000-->\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的问题单，请在这里描述问题单单号。-->\nIssue [#833](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/issues/833) \n\n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。包括但不限于二级冒烟、算子泛化等。-->\n本地自测220个用例通过\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n","assignees_number":12,"assignees":[{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68b95648f58fe35f2d169ed4","login":"gaoxiang618","name":"gaoxiang618","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gaoxiang618","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c115ac4dcd85262391d21a","login":"wenxin_fight","name":"wenxin_fight","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","login":"mabing1118","nam